| SQL standard          | ✅ Yes       | ❌ MySQL-specific           |
| MySQL support         | ✅           | ✅                          |
| Readability           | High        | High for simple conditions |
| Multiple conditions   | ✅ Excellent | ⚠️ Less suitable           |
| Short solution        | ❌           | ✅                          |
| Best for this problem | ✅           | ⭐                          |

